{"id":"vod_bf_42842","vodId":"42842","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"一起一起这里那里","name_cn":"一起一起这里那里","date":"2012-01-01","year":"2012","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://img.bfzypic.com/upload/vod/20230424-44/ea732f0ca4aa581af845ee322d2e6a9b.jpg"},"summary":"御庭摘希（大久保瑠美 配音）是一个有着紫色长发和呆毛的傲娇少女，个性呆萌又别扭的她有着一个心上人——音无伊御（冈本信彦 配音）。在伊御的眼中，摘希是一个需要照顾的小妹妹，这让摘希觉得十分抓狂。虽然完全没有自觉，但是伊御时常会做出一些让摘希无法承受的刺激举动。　　围绕着这一对友达以上恋人未满的笨蛋情侣的，是一群有趣又善良的朋友们。天然呆的春野姬（福原香织 配音）总是被爱捉弄人的科学怪人片濑真宵（生天目仁美 配音）耍得团团转；而有着僵硬症的戌井榊（浅沼晋太郎 配音）又总是在笑料达到高潮的时刻浑身僵直不能动弹。这群可爱的朋友们，围绕着他们而展开的日常就是这部动画所要表达的主要内容。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-04-29 23:08:28","playable":true,"episodeCount":13,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/yiqiyiqizhelinali/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/yiqiyiqizhelinali/第02集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/yiqiyiqizhelinali/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/yiqiyiqizhelinali/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/yiqiyiqizhelinali/第05集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/yiqiyiqizhelinali/第06集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/yiqiyiqizhelinali/第07集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/yiqiyiqizhelinali/第08集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/yiqiyiqizhelinali/第09集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/yiqiyiqizhelinali/第10集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/yiqiyiqizhelinali/第11集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/yiqiyiqizhelinali/第12集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/yiqiyiqizhelinali/第13集/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T